# Pushing domino A knocks over B, B knocks over C, C knocks over D. Someone pushed A.

entity a : e
entity b : e
entity c : e
entity d : e

push(patient: a)

rule: push(patient: a) -> knocked_over(theme: b)
rule: knocked_over(theme: b) -> knocked_over(theme: c)
rule: knocked_over(theme: c) -> knocked_over(theme: d)

? knocked_over(theme: d)